<title>UK: TABLE - Commercial Union H1 profit up 8.8 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Commercial Union H1 profit up 8.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Op earnings/shr (pence) 21.5		vs 20.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  12.25	     vs 11.45</p>
<p> Pretax op profit	  235		 vs 216</p>
<p> Total premium income    4,274	     vs 4,569</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits between 209 million stg and 228 million stg and a dividend between 12.2 pence and 12.3 pence. Full name of the British insurance group is Commercial Union Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
